---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="Artist bio and portfolio story">
  <section class="story">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Art shaped by observation and memory.</h1>

    <div class="story-grid">
      <p>
        My work is rooted in the quiet details of everyday life — the play of light, shifting weather,
        the textures of built environments, and the emotional rhythm of a place. I work across paintings,
        photography, sketches, and digital art, building a practice that moves fluidly between media.
      </p>

      <p>
        I’ve also developed curatorial projects and exhibitions that bring together work with a shared
        narrative, inviting viewers to experience a conversation between pieces rather than a single object in isolation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="category-list">
      <span>Paintings</span>
      <span>Photography</span>
      <span>Sketches</span>
      <span>Digital art</span>
      <span>Curatorial</span>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
